WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.300
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.100
You're here. You made it.
Thank you for tuning in.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.334
Thank you for watching.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.334 --> 00:00:10.000
Well, guys,
as if President Biden

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.901
isn't dealing with
enough right now, tomorrow,

00:00:11.901 --> 00:00:15.434
he will deliver his first
State of the Union address.

00:00:15.434 --> 00:00:16.968
What timing.

00:00:16.968 --> 00:00:18.334
It's like having
your wedding during

00:00:18.334 --> 00:00:21.667
a hurricane, an earthquake,
and a sharknado, you know?

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:23.601
The good news is
tough to come by,

00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:25.501
so half of Biden's speech
is about how he

00:00:25.501 --> 00:00:27.968
finally made
alcoholic Mountain Dew.

00:00:29.601 --> 00:00:31.667
Yep, Biden's been going
through a tough time,

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:34.100
so in order to gain support,
just for tomorrow,

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.601
he's changing
his last name to Zelensky.

00:00:38.701 --> 00:00:41.000
That's right -- as
conflict continues in Ukraine,

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.968
the world has been awestruck
by the heroics of

00:00:42.968 --> 00:00:45.667
President Zelensky,
who has stayed in Kiev

00:00:45.667 --> 00:00:48.100
and vowed to
fight for his country.

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:49.968
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah. Sure.

00:00:55.634 --> 00:00:58.100
The only way someone could be
more popular is if

00:00:58.100 --> 00:00:59.868
Ted Lasso became Spider-Man.

00:00:59.868 --> 00:01:02.100
That's the only way.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:04.200
The U.S. even offered
to evacuate him,

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:08.667
and he said,
"I need ammunition, not a ride."

00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:10.634
Yeah, that line is --
[ Applause ]

00:01:13.133 --> 00:01:15.067
That line is so good,
Vin Diesel is stealing it

00:01:15.067 --> 00:01:16.534
for the next "Fast &amp; Furious."

00:01:17.701 --> 00:01:19.767
Meanwhile, I read that a growing
number of U.S. officials

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:23.734
and their allies are questioning
Putin's mental state.

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:26.601
Yeah, Putin poisons his enemies'
underpants for a living,

00:01:26.601 --> 00:01:28.701
and now people are concerned?

00:01:29.868 --> 00:01:32.067
Today, to show he's still sharp,
Putin was like,

00:01:32.067 --> 00:01:35.434
"Person, woman,
man, Smirnoff, borscht.

00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:38.501
Person, woman, man,
Smirnoff, bor--"

00:01:38.501 --> 00:01:40.634
Speaking of Putin,
I saw that he just met with

00:01:40.634 --> 00:01:43.267
his top advisers, but take a
look at the seating arrangement.

00:01:43.267 --> 00:01:44.367
This is a real photo.

00:01:44.367 --> 00:01:47.634
Wow.

00:01:47.634 --> 00:01:49.968
That table is
from Pottery Barn's

00:01:49.968 --> 00:01:51.167
Germophobe collection.

00:01:51.167 --> 00:01:52.534
Yeah.

00:01:52.534 --> 00:01:53.634
That looks like how you seat

00:01:53.634 --> 00:01:57.000
your unvaccinated uncle
at Thanksgiving.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.334
Can I see the table again?

00:01:58.334 --> 00:02:00.667
Oh, my God.

00:02:00.667 --> 00:02:01.934
When they pass the memo
down the table,

00:02:01.934 --> 00:02:03.968
the entire Russian curling team
has to come out.

00:02:03.968 --> 00:02:05.267
You go...

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:08.267
Of course,
everyone is concerned about

00:02:08.267 --> 00:02:09.901
the situation in Ukraine.

00:02:09.901 --> 00:02:11.033
And here in the U.S.,
people have started

00:02:11.033 --> 00:02:13.767
boycotting Russian vodka.

00:02:13.767 --> 00:02:15.968
Yeah, Americans said,
"Look, if we have to rip

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:17.467
tequila shots
until this is over,

00:02:17.467 --> 00:02:19.901
then, by God, we will do it."

00:02:19.901 --> 00:02:21.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:23.033
Just do it.

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:28.734
But thanks to
harsh sanctions from countries

00:02:28.734 --> 00:02:30.267
all around the world,
Russia's economy

00:02:30.267 --> 00:02:33.067
is spiraling towards
a total collapse.

00:02:33.067 --> 00:02:34.501
Here's how bad things
have gotten.

00:02:34.501 --> 00:02:37.801
The ruble is now worth
one Chuck E. Cheese token.

00:02:39.767 --> 00:02:41.901
Yeah, almost everyone is
coming out against Russia.

00:02:41.901 --> 00:02:45.067
Today, even Switzerland --
Switzerland --

00:02:45.067 --> 00:02:48.167
broke their neutral status and
froze Putin's assets.

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:50.734
Right now, the Swiss Army
is like, "Attack formation!

00:02:50.734 --> 00:02:54.067
Knife! Corkscrew!
Weird, tiny scissors!"

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:58.601
Well, let's change gears.

00:02:58.601 --> 00:03:00.767
A new study found that people
will pay more attention to

00:03:00.767 --> 00:03:04.067
ads if they feature
dogs and cats.

00:03:04.067 --> 00:03:05.701
I guess companies
heard about this study,

00:03:05.701 --> 00:03:07.367
which explains this new ad
I just saw.

00:03:07.367 --> 00:03:08.434
Check this out.

00:03:08.434 --> 00:03:09.501
♪♪

00:03:09.501 --> 00:03:11.567
-Our company is dedicated
to making sure

00:03:11.567 --> 00:03:13.567
you're always satisfied.

00:03:13.567 --> 00:03:15.734
Whatever it takes to
ensure you're happy,

00:03:15.734 --> 00:03:17.467
we'll get the job done.

00:03:17.467 --> 00:03:19.067
You can count on it.

00:03:19.067 --> 00:03:20.734
Better ingredients.

00:03:20.734 --> 00:03:22.200
Better pizza.

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:23.901
Papa John's.

00:03:25.501 --> 00:03:27.968
-Wow!

00:03:27.968 --> 00:03:29.734
-Yeah.

00:03:29.734 --> 00:03:31.167
Did you guys see this
or hear about this?

00:03:31.167 --> 00:03:34.934
A man in New York just won
$10 million -- $10 million --

00:03:34.934 --> 00:03:36.801
from a scratch-off
lottery ticket.

00:03:36.801 --> 00:03:38.601
But here's the unbelievable
part -- not just that.

00:03:38.601 --> 00:03:40.901
The same man won
$10 million from

00:03:40.901 --> 00:03:43.934
another scratch-off ticket
three years ago.

00:03:43.934 --> 00:03:46.133
That's insane.

00:03:46.133 --> 00:03:47.901
Even crazier,
the same guy was behind him

00:03:47.901 --> 00:03:49.334
in line at 7-Eleven both times.

00:03:49.334 --> 00:03:51.033
Like, "Oh, come on!"

00:03:53.534 --> 00:03:55.033
And, finally,
a woman in Maryland

00:03:55.033 --> 00:03:57.067
lost her iPhone 10 years ago,

00:03:57.067 --> 00:04:00.701
and her husband just plunged it
out of their toilet.

00:04:00.701 --> 00:04:01.968
It was incredible.

00:04:01.968 --> 00:04:04.667
He found her phone
and some classified documents

00:04:04.667 --> 00:04:07.234
Trump flushed down there.

00:04:07.234 --> 00:04:08.968
Yep, after recovering
the iPhone,

00:04:08.968 --> 00:04:10.567
they turned it on,
and Siri said...

00:04:10.567 --> 00:04:12.801
-Oh, man, I have
seen some [bleep]

00:04:12.801 --> 00:04:14.000
-We have a great show.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:16.834
Give it up for The Roots,
ladies and gentlemen!

00:04:16.834 --> 00:04:18.834
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:38.033
Hey, everyone,
before we get started,

00:04:38.033 --> 00:04:41.467
obviously, our heart goes out to
everyone in Ukraine right now.

00:04:41.467 --> 00:04:43.667
There are families struggling
to figure out what to do,

00:04:43.667 --> 00:04:45.133
and they could really
use our help.

00:04:45.133 --> 00:04:46.567
If you would like to donate,
you can go to

00:04:46.567 --> 00:04:50.334
unicefusa.org/tonightshow.

00:04:50.334 --> 00:04:51.501
Anything you can give
will make a difference.

00:04:51.501 --> 00:04:52.634
Thank you very much.

